  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The chimney sweep is well-trained in taking his foes off guard and using this against them. At 1st level, whenever he makes a melee attack against a foe from whom he has any degree of concealment, he deals an additional +1d6 damage. This is precision damage and is not multiplied on a critical hit. Additionally, if he rolls an even number on this bonus damage die, the target is shaken for 1 round. A Will save (DC 10 + chimney sweep level) negates the shaken effect, this is a fear effect.</p>\n<p>At 4th level, and every three levels thereafter, he deals an additional +1d6 damage with strike from the smoke. For every even number rolled on his strike from the smoke damage dice, the target is shaken for 1 consecutive round. At 8th level, each round of shaken is instead a round where the target is frightened. At 15th level, this increases to the panicked condition.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/chimney-sweep#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
